  "description": "Backend-for-Frontend (BFF) for SPAs using Authagonal. A confidential OIDC client that runs the authorization-code + PKCE flow server-side, holds access/refresh tokens in a server-side session, and hands the browser only an httpOnly session cookie — no tokens in browser storage. Drop-in ASP.NET Core middleware: AddAuthagonalBff() + MapAuthagonalBff().",
